In fact I'd just suggest using different systems for ISO, for Chinese world
etc. Of course, its own Lojbani weekday numbering system might be the best.

{lurdei} system is based on planets and is a clearly an artlang thing.

I don't oppose other systems, I'm only paying attention to possible
confusion that 1=3DMonday can produce so better to learn days of weeks by
some associations. In fact {djacydei} or {djedrdjacu} or whatever with long
rafsi can be even more catchy.




